  "body": "The following are all missing:\r\n * worker_main_http_uri (cf #13642)\r\n * worker_manhole\r\n\r\nUpdate (dmr 2022-11-14): The following were missing, but then added in #14086:\r\n * Under \"coordinating workers\":\r\n   * worker_replication_secret\r\n   * start_pushers \r\n   * pusher_instances\r\n * Under \"individual worker configuration\":\r\n   * worker_app\r\n   * worker_name\r\n   * worker_replication_host\r\n   * worker_replication_http_port\r\n   * worker_listeners\r\n   * worker_daemonize\r\n   * worker_pid_file\r\n   * worker_log_config\r\n",
